OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feared for life' after
OL,4,Arival fan fell from stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has told a jury she thought she
OL,7,F"could have died" when a football fan
OL,8,Ffell on to her from the upper tier of a
OL,9,Fstand during a match.
OL,11,FJoanne Peters, who has scoliosis, was
OL,12,Finjured when 62-year-old John Ryan
OL,13,Flanded on her at Ipswich Town's Portman
OL,14,FRoad ground in January 2024.
OL,16,FIpswich Crown Court heard how Peters
OL,17,Finitially thought the box behind her
OL,18,Fhad collapsed and she had been left
OL,19,F"terrified" by the impact.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
