OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feared for life' after
OL,4,Arival fan fell from stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan, of Rochester Street, Chatham,
OL,7,FKent, denies one count of assault by
OL,8,Fbeating and one count of actual bodily
OL,9,Fharm. The jury has retired to consider
OL,10,Fits verdicts.
